  "components": [
    {
      "name": "Primary Button",
      "kind": "button",
      "refersTo": "button-primary",
      "description": "The one main action per view (Упаковать).",
      "html": "<button class=\"ds-btn-primary\">Упаковать</button>",
      "css": ".ds-btn-primary { height: 40px; padding: 0 20px; border: 0; border-radius: 6px; background: var(--accent-fill, #ff7a1a); color: var(--accent-ink, #1a0d00); font-family: \"IBM Plex Sans\", -apple-system, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 500; box-shadow: 0 1px 2px rgb(0 0 0 / .08); cursor: pointer; transition: filter .15s ease-out; } .ds-btn-primary:hover { filter: brightness(1.06); } .ds-btn-primary:focus-visible { outline: 2px solid var(--accent, #9c3d00); outline-offset: 2px; } .ds-btn-primary[disabled] { opacity: .45; cursor: not-allowed; }"
    },
    {
      "name": "Secondary Button",
      "kind": "button",
      "refersTo": "button-secondary",
      "description": "Secondary actions (Скачать 3MF, Отменить).",
      "html": "<button class=\"ds-btn\"><svg class=\"ds-ic\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M12 4v11M7 10l5 5 5-5M5 20h14\"/></svg>Скачать 3MF</button>",
      "css": ".ds-btn { height: 32px; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; padding: 0 14px; border: 1px solid var(--border-strong, #aba299); border-radius: 6px; background: var(--panel, #f8f6f3); color: var(--text, #1b1916); font-family: \"IBM Plex Sans\", -apple-system, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 500; cursor: pointer; transition: background .15s ease-out; } .ds-btn:hover { background: var(--hover, #d9d3cc); } .ds-btn:focus-visible { outline: 2px solid var(--accent, #9c3d00); outline-offset: 2px; } .ds-ic { width: 16px; height: 16px; fill: none; stroke: currentColor; stroke-width: 1.75; stroke-linecap: round; stroke-linejoin: round; }"
    },
    {
      "name": "Text Field",
      "kind": "input",
      "refersTo": "input",
      "description": "Labelled 32px field with hint.",
      "html": "<label class=\"ds-field\"><span class=\"ds-label\">Смена прутка, с</span><input class=\"ds-input\" value=\"42.5\"><span class=\"ds-hint\">Из калибровки AMS</span></label>",
      "css": ".ds-field { display: grid; gap: 5px; width: 260px; font-family: \"IBM Plex Sans\", -apple-system, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; } .ds-label { font-weight: 500; color: var(--text, #1b1916); } .ds-hint { font-size: 12px; color: var(--dim, #5a5249); } .ds-input { height: 32px; padding: 0 10px; border: 1px solid var(--border-strong, #aba299); border-radius: 6px; background: var(--panel, #f8f6f3); color: var(--text, #1b1916); font: 13px \"JetBrains Mono\", ui-monospace, monospace; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; transition: border-color .15s ease-out, box-shadow .15s ease-out; } .ds-input:focus { outline: none; border-color: var(--accent, #9c3d00); box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px var(--accent-soft, #ff7a1a26); }"
    },
    {
      "name": "Segmented Control",
      "kind": "custom",
      "refersTo": "segmented",
      "description": "Small exclusive choice (layout mode).",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-seg\"><button class=\"on\">Плотно</button><button>Сеткой</button></div>",
      "css": ".ds-seg { display: inline-grid; grid-auto-flow: column; grid-auto-columns: 1fr; width: 240px; padding: 2px; background: var(--panel-2, #e0dbd5); border: 1px solid var(--border, #cdc6be); border-radius: 6px; } .ds-seg button { height: 26px; border: 0; border-radius: 4px; background: transparent; color: var(--muted, #5a5249); font-family: \"IBM Plex Sans\", -apple-system, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 12.5px; font-weight: 500; cursor: pointer; } .ds-seg button.on { background: var(--panel, #f8f6f3); color: var(--text, #1b1916); box-shadow: 0 1px 2px rgb(0 0 0 / .08), 0 0 0 1px var(--border, #cdc6be); } .ds-seg button:focus-visible { outline: 2px solid var(--accent, #9c3d00); outline-offset: 2px; }"
    },
    {
      "name": "Sidebar Navigation",
      "kind": "nav",
      "refersTo": "nav-item",
      "description": "Collapsible left nav, 208px (rail 56px).",
      "html": "<nav class=\"ds-nav\"><a class=\"on\" href=\"#\"><svg class=\"ds-ic\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M12 3 20 7.5v9L12 21l-8-4.5v-9Z\"/><path d=\"M4 7.5 12 12l8-4.5M12 12v9\"/></svg>Упаковка</a><a href=\"#\"><svg class=\"ds-ic\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><rect x=\"3.5\" y=\"5\" width=\"17\" height=\"15\" rx=\"2\"/><path d=\"M3.5 10h17M8 3v4M16 3v4\"/></svg>Расписание</a><a href=\"#\"><svg class=\"ds-ic\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M9 6h11M9 12h11M9 18h11M4 6h.01M4 12h.01M4 18h.01\"/></svg>Мои задачи</a></nav>",
      "css": ".ds-nav { width: 208px; display: grid; gap: 2px; padding: 10px 8px; background: var(--chrome, #e3ded8); font-family: \"IBM Plex Sans\", -apple-system, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; } .ds-nav a { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 11px; height: 34px; padding: 0 11px; border-radius: 6px; color: var(--muted, #5a5249); font-weight: 500; text-decoration: none; transition: background .15s ease-out, color .15s ease-out; } .ds-nav a:hover { background: var(--hover, #d9d3cc); color: var(--text, #1b1916); } .ds-nav a.on { background: var(--accent-soft, #ff7a1a26); color: var(--text, #1b1916); } .ds-nav a.on .ds-ic { color: var(--accent, #9c3d00); } .ds-nav a:focus-visible { outline: 2px solid var(--accent, #9c3d00); outline-offset: 2px; } .ds-ic { width: 16px; height: 16px; fill: none; stroke: currentColor; stroke-width: 1.75; stroke-linecap: round; stroke-linejoin: round; }"
    },
    {
      "name": "Status Pills",
      "kind": "chip",
      "refersTo": "pill-ok",
      "description": "Job status only.",
      "html": "<span class=\"ds-pill ok\">Готово</span> <span class=\"ds-pill run\">Идёт</span> <span class=\"ds-pill err\">Ошибка</span> <span class=\"ds-pill q\">В очереди</span>",
      "css": ".ds-pill { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px; padding: 2px 9px; border-radius: 999px; font-family: \"IBM Plex Sans\", -apple-system, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 500; } .ds-pill::before { content: \"\"; width: 6px; height: 6px; border-radius: 50%; background: currentColor; } .ds-pill.ok { background: var(--ok-soft, #1f7a3a1f); color: var(--ok, #1f7a3a); } .ds-pill.run { background: var(--accent-soft, #ff7a1a26); color: var(--accent, #9c3d00); } .ds-pill.err { background: var(--crit-soft, #c428471a); color: var(--crit, #c42847); } .ds-pill.q { background: var(--panel-2, #e0dbd5); color: var(--muted, #5a5249); }"
    },
    {
      "name": "Stage Progress",
      "kind": "custom",
      "refersTo": "progress-bar",
      "description": "Signature: one bar, segments proportional to stage shares.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-prog\"><div class=\"ds-prog-line\"><b>Нарезка</b><span>идёт 1:12 · осталось ~3 мин</span></div><div class=\"ds-bar\"><i class=\"d\" style=\"flex:8\"></i><i class=\"d\" style=\"flex:30\"></i><i class=\"d\" style=\"flex:6\"></i><i class=\"c\" style=\"flex:40;--p:45%\"></i><i style=\"flex:10\"></i><i class=\"s\" style=\"flex:6\"></i></div></div>",
      "css": ".ds-prog { display: grid; gap: 8px; width: 520px; font-family: \"IBM Plex Sans\", -apple-system, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; color: var(--text, #1b1916); } .ds-prog-line { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; } .ds-prog-line b { font-weight: 600; } .ds-prog-line span { font-family: \"JetBrains Mono\", ui-monospace, monospace; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; color: var(--muted, #5a5249); } .ds-bar { display: flex; gap: 2px; height: 8px; border-radius: 4px; overflow: hidden; background: var(--panel-2, #e0dbd5); } .ds-bar i { background: var(--border-strong, #aba299); opacity: .35; } .ds-bar i.d { background: var(--signal, #ff7a1a); opacity: 1; } .ds-bar i.c { background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--signal, #ff7a1a) var(--p), transparent var(--p)), var(--border-strong, #aba299); opacity: 1; } .ds-bar i.s { background: repeating-linear-gradient(135deg, var(--border-strong, #aba299) 0 3px, transparent 3px 6px); opacity: .5; }"
    },
    {
      "name": "Result Banner",
      "kind": "card",
      "refersTo": "result-banner-ok",
      "description": "Tonal success/error card with stats.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-result\"><svg class=\"ds-ic\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"9\"/><path d=\"m8 12 3 3 5-6\"/></svg><div><b>Стол готов: 38 объектов</b><p>Нарезано без конфликтов</p></div><div class=\"ds-stats\"><div><span>Время</span><b>4:12</b></div><div><span>Плотность</span><b>71%</b></div></div></div>",
      "css": ".ds-result { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 16px; padding: 14px 16px; border-radius: 10px; background: var(--ok-soft, #1f7a3a1f); color: var(--text, #1b1916); font-family: \"IBM Plex Sans\", -apple-system, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; } .ds-result > .ds-ic { width: 20px; height: 20px; color: var(--ok, #1f7a3a); fill: none; stroke: currentColor; stroke-width: 1.75; stroke-linecap: round; stroke-linejoin: round; } .ds-result b { font-weight: 600; font-size: 14px; } .ds-result p { margin: 2px 0 0; color: var(--muted, #5a5249); } .ds-stats { display: flex; gap: 28px; } .ds-stats div { display: grid; } .ds-stats span { font-size: 12px; color: var(--dim, #5a5249); } .ds-stats b { font: 500 15px \"JetBrains Mono\", ui-monospace, monospace; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }"
    }
  ],
  "narrative": {
    "northStar": "Камень и искра (Stone & Spark)",
    "overview": "**Creative North Star: \"Камень и искра\" (Stone & Spark)**\n\nThe interface is a workshop bench: warm stone in daylight, warm charcoal at night, dense and quiet so the work on it is what you see. One bright signal orange is the spark. It marks what the user can do (the primary action) and what the machine is doing right now (progress, the slicing plane). A single green is reserved for geometry truth: the measured projection contour, the tower, \"готово\". Everything else is tonal stone.\n\nMode is **Operate**: a product UI used for minutes at a time next to a slicer. Precision and restraint beat expression. Familiar patterns, 13px body, tight but legible density, numbers in a monospaced face that never jitters. Brand lives in the details (the spark, the scene), not in decoration.\n\nIt is warm but deliberately not the Anthropic look: dense grey-beige stone instead of pale cream, a loud signal orange instead of clay, a grotesque instead of a serif.",
    "keyCharacteristics": [
      "Two themes of one material: stone (light) and warm charcoal (dark), switched with `data-theme`.",
      "One spark (orange) for action and machine progress; one green for geometry truth and success.",
      "Flat tonal layering; shadows only on floating layers.",
      "IBM Plex Sans for UI, JetBrains Mono with tabular figures for every number.",
      "Thin 24px stroke icons from one sprite."
    ],
    "rules": [
      {
        "name": "The One Spark Rule",
        "body": "Orange appears only where the user acts (`accent-fill`) or the machine works (`signal`). Never as decoration, section color or illustration fill.",
        "section": "colors"
      },
      {
        "name": "The Burnt-on-Stone Rule",
        "body": "On light surfaces orange text is only `#9c3d00`. `#ff7a1a` is fill-only on light (2.4:1 as text, fails).",
        "section": "colors"
      },
      {
        "name": "The Truth Is Green Rule",
        "body": "Green means \"measured and correct\": projection contour, tower, success. Not for categories, not for charts, not for night bands.",
        "section": "colors"
      },
      {
        "name": "The Tabular Rule",
        "body": "Any number that can change or be compared is mono with `font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums`. Prose numbers (\"24 ч\") may stay in Plex.",
        "section": "typography"
      },
      {
        "name": "The No-Shouting Rule",
        "body": "No uppercase labels, no letterspaced eyebrows, no display sizes above 22px. Hierarchy comes from weight and space.",
        "section": "typography"
      },
      {
        "name": "The Same-Place Rule",
        "body": "Progress and results render in the column where the job started. No navigation for status.",
        "section": "layout"
      },
      {
        "name": "The Floating-Only Rule",
        "body": "If it does not float above the page or is not the pressed choice, it has no shadow.",
        "section": "elevation"
      }
    ],
    "dos": [
      "**Do** keep orange to the primary action, progress and the slice plane; one primary button per view.",
      "**Do** use `#9c3d00` for orange text and icons on light, `#ff7a1a` only as a fill with `#1a0d00` ink.",
      "**Do** use green only for the projection contour, tower and success states.",
      "**Do** set every changing number in JetBrains Mono with tabular figures.",
      "**Do** separate regions with tonal steps and 1px hairlines; reserve shadows for menus and the pressed segment.",
      "**Do** write UI copy in Russian, plain and specific: \"Упаковать\", \"Отменить\", \"Стол готов\", \"Откалибровать заново…\"; hide internal jargon (\"Фаза 1\", `final_slice`).",
      "**Do** give every interactive element the 2px `accent` focus outline (inputs: accent border + 3px soft ring).",
      "**Do** keep transitions at 150–200ms ease-out and honor `prefers-reduced-motion`.",
      "**Do** draw icons as 24px stroke paths (1.75, round) in one sprite."
    ],
    "donts": [
      "**Don't** use pale cream backgrounds (the `#faf9f5` / `#f0eee6` family); light bg stays dense stone `#ebe7e2`.",
      "**Don't** use clay orange (the `#d97757` family) or any second orange.",
      "**Don't** use a serif or a display face anywhere.",
      "**Don't** use gradient text, eyebrow labels, uppercase letterspaced captions or decorative glow.",
      "**Don't** nest cards inside cards; a card holds rows, fields or a figure, not another card.",
      "**Don't** use colored `border-left` stripes for callouts or banners; use a tonal `-soft` background and an icon.",
      "**Don't** use emoji as icons or status markers.",
      "**Don't** use pills for anything except status and stub tags.",
      "**Don't** use `accent-2` green for categorical data (e.g. night bands in the schedule Gantt); use a neutral or hatching instead.",
      "**Don't** animate fake progress when real stage data exists."
    ]
  }
}